OL,3,GNEWSAHow many times has Clare's Law
OL,4,Abeen used in the West of England?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman is killed every five days by
OL,7,Fan abusive partner in England and
OL,8,FWales, as millions of others remain in
OL,9,Fviolent relationships.
OL,11,FClare's Law allows people to find out
OL,12,Fif a current or former partner has a
OL,13,Fhistory of abusive or violent
OL,14,Fbehaviour. It is named after Clare Wood
OL,15,Fwho was murdered by her partner.
OL,17,FDet Supt Sue Feraday, from
OL,18,FGloucestershire Police, said many
OL,19,Fpeople in her area are unaware they can
OL,20,Faccess the information.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
