OL,3,GNEWSAHow many times has Clare's Law
OL,4,Abeen used in the West of England?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You could be a friend, family member,
OL,7,Fneighbour, hairdresser or the person in
OL,8,Fthe relationship, or even a
OL,9,Fprofessional like social services," she
OL,10,Fadded.
